  m_text: 'WASD            Move

    Mouse           Look

    Shift           Sprint 
    (loud)

    C / Ctrl        Crouch  (quiet, low)

    E               Interact
    / hide

    Right mouse     Aim a stone

    Left mouse      Throw it

    Esc            
    Pause


    Guards show a badge above their head:

    it fills while they are
    noticing you.

    Break line of sight or hide before it

    turns into a red
    exclamation mark.'
